<section class="components-page form-elements-page">
  <div class="card app-card component-section"><div class="card-header"><h5 class="card-title mb-0">Snow Theme</h5></div><div class="card-body"><div class="editor-toolbar" data-editor-toolbar="snowEditor"><button type="button" data-editor-command="bold"><i class="bi bi-type-bold"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="italic"><i class="bi bi-type-italic"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="underline"><i class="bi bi-type-underline"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="insertUnorderedList"><i class="bi bi-list-ul"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="insertOrderedList"><i class="bi bi-list-ol"></i></button></div><div class="editor-surface" id="snowEditor" contenteditable="true"><h6>Quill Rich Text Editor</h6><p>Cupcake ipsum dolor sit amet. Halvah cheesecake chocolate bar gummi bears cupcake. Pie macaroon danish donut.</p><p><strong>Use the toolbar</strong> to format this editable content block.</p></div></div></div>
  <div class="card app-card component-section"><div class="card-header"><h5 class="card-title mb-0">Bubble Theme</h5></div><div class="card-body"><div class="editor-surface editor-bubble" id="bubbleEditor" contenteditable="true"><p>Select text and use keyboard shortcuts such as Ctrl+B or Ctrl+I. This lightweight static-friendly editor mimics the editable behavior without adding a vendor dependency.</p></div></div></div>
  <div class="card app-card component-section"><div class="card-header"><h5 class="card-title mb-0">Full Editor</h5></div><div class="card-body"><div class="editor-toolbar" data-editor-toolbar="fullEditor"><button type="button" data-editor-command="bold"><i class="bi bi-type-bold"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="italic"><i class="bi bi-type-italic"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="justifyLeft"><i class="bi bi-text-left"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="justifyCenter"><i class="bi bi-text-center"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="justifyRight"><i class="bi bi-text-right"></i></button><button type="button" data-editor-command="formatBlock" data-editor-value="h4">H4</button><button type="button" data-editor-command="formatBlock" data-editor-value="p">P</button></div><div class="editor-surface editor-large" id="fullEditor" contenteditable="true"><h4>Full Editor</h4><p>Use this component when the admin template needs a larger content writing surface, such as article, course, or announcement editing.</p></div></div></div>
</section>